<div class="panel active" id="panel-summary">
<div class="csection">

<div class="section-title">Overview</div>
<div class="kpi-strip">
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Total Fusions</div>
    <div class="kpi-value info">{s["n_total"]:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">all SV-gene pairs</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Unique SVs</div>
    <div class="kpi-value info">{s["n_unique_variants"]:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">underlying variants</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Inter-Gene</div>
    <div class="kpi-value info">{s["n_inter"]:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(s["n_inter"], s["n_total"])} of events</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Intragenic</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">{s["n_intra"]:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(s["n_intra"], s["n_total"])} of events</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Pathogenic / LP</div>
    <div class="kpi-value {kpi_path_cls}">{n_path:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(n_path, s["n_total"])} of all</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">VUS (inter)</div>
    <div class="kpi-value warn">{s["path_inter"].get("Uncertain_Significance",0):,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(s["path_inter"].get("Uncertain_Significance",0), s["n_inter"])} of inter</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Canonical</div>
    <div class="kpi-value ok">{n_canon:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(n_canon, s["n_inter"])} of inter</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">In-Frame</div>
    <div class="kpi-value ok">{n_inframe:,}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">{pct(n_inframe, s["n_inter"])} of inter</div></div>
</div>

<div class="section-title">Cohort Interpretation</div>
<div class="stat-block">
  <p>This cohort contains <span class="stat-blue">{s["n_total"]:,} total fusion events</span>
  across <span class="stat-blue">{s["n_unique_variants"]:,} underlying SVs</span>.
  Of these, <span class="stat-blue">{s["n_inter"]:,} ({pct(s["n_inter"],s["n_total"])})</span>
  are inter-gene fusions and
  <span class="stat-blue">{s["n_intra"]:,} ({pct(s["n_intra"],s["n_total"])})</span>
  are intragenic events.</p>
  <p>Among inter-gene fusions, <span class="stat-blue">{n_canon} ({pct(n_canon,s["n_inter"])})</span>
  are canonical and
  <span class="stat-ok">{n_inframe} ({pct(n_inframe,s["n_inter"])})</span>
  have a confirmed in-frame junction.</p>
  <p>Pathogenicity: <span class="stat-hi">{n_path} ({pct(n_path,s["n_total"])})</span>
  Pathogenic/LP &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <span class="stat-mid">{n_vus:,} ({pct(n_vus,s["n_total"])})</span> VUS &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <span class="stat-ok">{n_benign:,} ({pct(n_benign,s["n_total"])})</span>
  Likely Benign/Benign. Mean ACMG score: <span class="stat-blue">{mean_score}</span>.</p>
</div>
{callout_html}

