      <span class="card-legend-val">Confidence score: <strong>0.5 × (supporting SV count) + 0.5 × (distinct SV types)</strong>. Higher = more independent evidence. Score of 1.0 = one SV of one type; 2.0 = two SVs or two distinct types.</span>
